{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13220450","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220450","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1322045001:1":{"text":"You're pretty strong. Not many can defeat me. You're an interesting one, but you spout nonsense!","source_cn":"你很强，你能打赢我！你很有趣，但是说的话太无聊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE98BFD81B23E2C03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322045002:1":{"text":"I just want to take my son home.","source_cn":"我只想带走我的儿子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82761D6D511585B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322045003:1":{"text":"No matter who you are or what you want, I won't allow you to hurt Daimon!","source_cn":"无论你们是谁，也无论你们想干什么，我都不允许你们伤害戴蒙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78211A1BF975D73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1322045003":{"text":"No matter who you are or what you want, I won't allow you to hurt Daimon!","source_cn":"无论你们是谁，也无论你们想干什么，我都不允许你们伤害戴蒙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78211A1BF975D73B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322045004:1":{"text":"He's not like you... He can't protect himself. Anyone or anything could hurt him.","source_cn":"不！他不像你们……没有自保的能力，随便一个人都有可能会..."